{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月ももう\nあっという間に終わってしまうんだろうな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日噛み締めなきゃな〜と\n本当に思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーのおもいで、☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J98X2S38MWZ0FMF46BA4S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J99XXDJMXWRX6BMNXKXE4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいとちゃんかあいいね。ほんと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9B3B5R0SGSGXHCKX7QV6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9C2V1PH8E3GKD3Q1EM1B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9D128AG9BNGH0N7BVZ4A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9E0TM0B1XX5ZDQRM531K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nドーム最高に楽しかったです！\n胸がいっぱいになる瞬間が\n数え切れないほどありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9F0HEXPTFEAMKD57XC2C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9FZX3BTE3TJGG7EZX3RT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n最近は髪暗くしたりもしてみてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9H0ZCEQAQZW81B6EMHEW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9J23HHRJEQPFY7JPFFHR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9K02E0HACPD2J6EX9RZV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n愛し合いなさい\nみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9KY787C9C081MAZ5E8MT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nEX大衆さん\nみてね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9MY384YA5F3S5XM9B6BX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nテレ朝夏祭り\n丸美屋さんとサクラミーツがコラボさせていただくことになりました！メニュー楽しみにしててね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9NYEMFXSK8A10M403DS0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9PXZ5SKTAQXAAEH5GRRR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9QWRZYHQQ2995NTJTN4J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nみんなの願いは叶った？\n私はBuddiesにいっぱい叶えてもらったよ\n恩返しさせて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9RWYHEREAK42KDEYVSSW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9SWFXKQ1X4T1GMEGW91G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこの2日間もたのしかった！\nみんなの声が聞けるって、\n大好きな声を聞きながらステージに立てるって、\n本当に最高だね！ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせもさせてください👍🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/26(金) 19時より\n日本テレビ『クイズ！あなたは小学5年生より賢いの？』\n出演させていただきます🌠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9TXPHC5FK73XV70WDZH9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n緊張と興奮がずっと交互にやってくる時間でした！今思い出してもドキドキするーーー！楽しかったなあ…見守っててください☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後！同じく26日(金) 25時15分より\nテレビ朝日『しくじり先生 俺みたいになるな!!』\n出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J9VYB8F8B6YJK4X2KXC36","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nカズレーザー先生の授業を受けさせていただきました。しくじり先生の授業は本当に人生の教訓になります…めちゃくちゃ面白かったですし、刺さります…👨‍🏫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも続けて是非ご覧ください！\nそれでは。またね！"}],"source":"archive"}